        "TileImage": "$($repository db928f7b-bf66-4b43-82aa-e79b8a788e76).Image",
        "Description": "A celebration in the vineyards hides more than just wine-stained secrets. Among the guests, workers, and guards mingling under the Argentine sun, three individuals have crossed a line — one out of greed, one out of loyalty, and one out of fear.\r\rTonight, the party ends early for them. One guest, one worker, one guard — each playing a role in a betrayal too dangerous to ignore. Blend in with the crowd, strike with precision, and leave nothing but silence in your wake. The vines won’t tell — but t",
